<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-29T02:40:01.832Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:40:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has resumed airstrikes in southern Syria targeting Daesh militants, while Syrian authorities condemn the raids as a breach of airspace and report civilian casualties. Syrian security forces killed a French jihadist in a shootout in Harem and another French fighter in Idlib, and unidentified gunmen killed two Syrian defence ministry personnel in Idlib. The two sides have reopened a border crossing and agreed to a joint investigation into the strikes. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/unacceptable-violation-syria-condemns-jordan-airstrikes&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxNM3hNRVMzWUVOdUJ0a3R2bUk4MktaMFJaX3h4Mld5X3FfRXdJVVVNUTZQa3RMRmxmTFhqRnNjczlZaW9BZlBjd3hfZXl5YVlObkVGZGhlOGZ5Z0wyaUYweFBWcVQxYlJ5S1NBd1N3cWdQMEsyWDRZSm9lcmptNWRHUVdST1BxU0tiLUxTRWVlc3R4TUd0Y05jNTI4MlNCUjNIOWlZdkNxR01nNXZNZHllWldQRnRtalBodHo0Nk1kZlJ5Ujg1TDFPT2l6TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNZHk1ZHJHQ25NTzFlTGZNY3VuY0ZoNFFIYlZyWS1BSTNYcW1kOWNwT2lqLUhCUHJaaUVzZzR3Qnl6a2FqYUppbHVvd0NJdmdEYTdMdTlGVjJ6XzQ5a3dieEs5cm9GdlMtajdLRGdyR3BsRnplS1RWcUNTTm8yelZCNnFnTElhU040ZDRqT194QVd3dWVz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Foundation for Defense of Democracies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPeE51LUQ1Mk9RTDFnRjVENFh3T3JXVUlsTGJmeS1QaFluV0s3SEhXQXhHODhGQWQwa04wWW1SWTg3VDNxWndEeDNmSjZlYmJfc201bW95TUhmX2RJQXpkRFZJUHhUSm1Ua0RoOHhSdWhHVUwzUEw4Z1Y5czFqVUFsTGpJalZSRzBZSkg3M1lG